[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4501.83, "timestamp": "01:15:01", "text": "抓到你了。所以，你是从哪里找到的？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4504.63, "timestamp": "01:15:04", "text": "它在这里。稍等片刻。那"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4507.11, "timestamp": "01:15:07", "text": "桌子。表格在此。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4510.35, "timestamp": "01:15:10", "text": "它在这里。这是工作。全部"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4513.669, "timestamp": "01:15:13", "text": "正确的。哦，5:35。所以，我们需要放置"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4515.99, "timestamp": "01:15:15", "text": "时钟，然后按下按钮，把它按下去。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4518.709, "timestamp": "01:15:18", "text": "需要写成5:35。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4521.03, "timestamp": "01:15:21", "text": "所以，这就是我们接下来要讲的内容。好的，我们去……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4531.189, "timestamp": "01:15:31", "text": "好的。糟糕。嘿。你好先生，我来了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4533.43, "timestamp": "01:15:33", "text": "我要去蒂华纳。我来了。我会来的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4536.149, "timestamp": "01:15:36", "text": "给你。哥们儿，你不是认真的吧？来"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4538.31, "timestamp": "01:15:38", "text": "在。离开。你身上有股臭味。在哪里？在哪里？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4539.149, "timestamp": "01:15:39", "text": "它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4542.47, "timestamp": "01:15:42", "text": "再次？你不能喜欢呃哦，等等。我是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4546.149, "timestamp": "01:15:46", "text": "垂死。我要死了。嘿，看。你 你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4548.95, "timestamp": "01:15:48", "text": "我帮不了我朋友。帮助。帮助。它是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4551.75, "timestamp": "01:15:51", "text": "好的。别理他。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4554.149, "timestamp": "01:15:54", "text": "是啊，他只是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4558.31, "timestamp": "01:15:58", "text": "嗯，是的。关上门。特写。呃，他"}]